    "name": "Snake Eyes",
    "steam_appid": 3825410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/6582735b1500932309c4a747501442bb.poster.avif?t=1750723149\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/6582735b1500932309c4a747501442bb.webm?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/6582735b1500932309c4a747501442bb.mp4?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake Eyes is a bullet hell top down 2D rougelike where you assume the role of a vengeful snake on a quest to take down the casino that took her arm. Using her homemade Slot Machine Gun, she'll parry, dodge, and blast her way through the Snake Eyes Casino while finding unique items to assist her on the path of vengeance. Shoot your way through the streets, game rooms, and VIP lounges of the Snake Eyes Casino with an array of unique bullets and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/90d1bef4fcf6bffa49a65676cd1cc43f.poster.avif?t=1750723149\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/90d1bef4fcf6bffa49a65676cd1cc43f.webm?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/90d1bef4fcf6bffa49a65676cd1cc43f.mp4?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your Slot Machine Gun, a unique gun that relies on slot machine logic to provide your ammunition. One reload may spin you a shotgun shell, sniper round, and a shuriken. While the next may give a flamethrower, piranha, and baseball bat. Your playstyle will be forced to rapidly adjust as each bullet requires different strategy to make effective. If you are lucky enough, you may even spin a Jackpot and unleash the devastating power of an extreme version of the base bullet.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/5c45e426786b6f80d700432a10d060c3.poster.avif?t=1750723149\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/5c45e426786b6f80d700432a10d060c3.webm?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/5c45e426786b6f80d700432a10d060c3.mp4?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your quest you may find unique items that will fine tune a unique playstyle each run. One run may give you items dropping mines with each dodge roll, while another may provide items that create sentries whenever you parry. The possibilities are immense!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/b08b2a45b0a1d3b3caecd6512085a7bc.poster.avif?t=1750723149\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/b08b2a45b0a1d3b3caecd6512085a7bc.webm?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/b08b2a45b0a1d3b3caecd6512085a7bc.mp4?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash hell upon the Snake Eyes Mafia that seeks to end your crusade. Whether it be dogs, penguins, or fellow snakes, they will stop at nothing to put an end to your rampage. Each of them utilizing unique weapons to try and put you down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight through three tumultuous levels. Beginning in the slums outside the casino, the glamorous iced casino floor, and finally the climactic showdown in the prestigious VIP lounge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble on revenge in Snake Eyes!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/f5722e692910f64513ac29ba6de9c8ea.avif?t=1750723149\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/6582735b1500932309c4a747501442bb.poster.avif?t=1750723149\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/6582735b1500932309c4a747501442bb.webm?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/6582735b1500932309c4a747501442bb.mp4?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake Eyes is a bullet hell top down 2D rougelike where you assume the role of a vengeful snake on a quest to take down the casino that took her arm. Using her homemade Slot Machine Gun, she'll parry, dodge, and blast her way through the Snake Eyes Casino while finding unique items to assist her on the path of vengeance. Shoot your way through the streets, game rooms, and VIP lounges of the Snake Eyes Casino with an array of unique bullets and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/90d1bef4fcf6bffa49a65676cd1cc43f.poster.avif?t=1750723149\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/90d1bef4fcf6bffa49a65676cd1cc43f.webm?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/90d1bef4fcf6bffa49a65676cd1cc43f.mp4?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your Slot Machine Gun, a unique gun that relies on slot machine logic to provide your ammunition. One reload may spin you a shotgun shell, sniper round, and a shuriken. While the next may give a flamethrower, piranha, and baseball bat. Your playstyle will be forced to rapidly adjust as each bullet requires different strategy to make effective. If you are lucky enough, you may even spin a Jackpot and unleash the devastating power of an extreme version of the base bullet.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/5c45e426786b6f80d700432a10d060c3.poster.avif?t=1750723149\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/5c45e426786b6f80d700432a10d060c3.webm?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/5c45e426786b6f80d700432a10d060c3.mp4?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your quest you may find unique items that will fine tune a unique playstyle each run. One run may give you items dropping mines with each dodge roll, while another may provide items that create sentries whenever you parry. The possibilities are immense!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/b08b2a45b0a1d3b3caecd6512085a7bc.poster.avif?t=1750723149\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/b08b2a45b0a1d3b3caecd6512085a7bc.webm?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/b08b2a45b0a1d3b3caecd6512085a7bc.mp4?t=1750723149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash hell upon the Snake Eyes Mafia that seeks to end your crusade. Whether it be dogs, penguins, or fellow snakes, they will stop at nothing to put an end to your rampage. Each of them utilizing unique weapons to try and put you down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight through three tumultuous levels. Beginning in the slums outside the casino, the glamorous iced casino floor, and finally the climactic showdown in the prestigious VIP lounge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble on revenge in Snake Eyes!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825410/extras/f5722e692910f64513ac29ba6de9c8ea.avif?t=1750723149\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p>",
